Revision history for perlomp

0.01  2026-09-05
      - Initial release.
      - Added a perl*-style manual page for using OpenMP from Perl.
      - Documented the roles of OpenMP, OpenMP::Environment,
        OpenMP::Simple, and Alien::OpenMP.
      - Added quick starts for Inline::C and external OpenMP executables.
      - Documented OpenMP runtime initialization, environment validation,
        native-thread safety considerations, portability, and installation.
